      },
      "exceptions": [
        {
          "statedAs": {
            "text": "(f) game birds, other than turkey, grouse and ptarmigan, with a rifle,",
            "lang": "en-CA"
          },
          "citation": "s. 17 (1) (f) — grouse and ptarmigan are carved out of this prohibition"
        }
      ],
      "unresolved": [
        "Recorded with empty speciesIds on purpose: s. 17 (1) (f) prohibits rifles for game birds OTHER than turkey, grouse and ptarmigan, so it does not reach any of the five birds in scope. The carve-out removes this prohibition; it is not itself a statement that rifles are ALLOWED for grouse or ptarmigan. No provision read states rifles are allowed for grouse or ptarmigan; s. 17 (1) (a) rifle-ammunition limits still apply."
      ]
    },
